'''Wave Dummy''' is an animated [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]] found in the [[Ranking Dojo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Wave Dummy
|image = E 693 en.png
|first appearance = [[Arena of Power/Waves of Attack|Arena of Honor]]
}}

==Enemy==
Compared to its other variants, the [[Dummy (Enemy Base)|Dummy]] and [[Artillery Dummy (Enemy Base)|Artillery Dummy]], the Wave Dummy takes much longer to attack, but fires off an extremely powerful Lv.20 Wave Attack when it does, wiping out every single unit on the field unless they are immune to waves or are a wave shield.

==Strategy==
To prevent this menacing scarecrow from wiping the field clean of cats you should bring wave immune units, or preferably a wave blocker. Other than that just use units that outrange it so they don't die.

